WEBVTT

00:00.107 --> 00:30.064
Pinoco's School Entrance Exam Journal

00:00.607 --> 00:01.780
Pinoco makes a huge hassle!

00:01.899 --> 00:03.580
I get in the middle of a school entrance exam!

00:03.647 --> 00:04.774
Just watch, Doc.

00:04.847 --> 00:07.140
I'll work hard and get accepted!

00:07.300 --> 00:08.960
I want to go to school.

00:09.026 --> 00:11.127
Can't Pinoco-chan be granted that wish?

00:11.180 --> 00:11.947
What's your point?

00:11.987 --> 00:14.147
I see your situation.

00:14.253 --> 00:16.396
So, does she excel academically?

00:16.603 --> 00:18.793
In anything, you must start at the basics.

00:18.826 --> 00:20.662
I don't have enough fingers.

00:20.772 --> 00:21.267
Start.

00:23.981 --> 00:26.120
But Pinoco is different from regular people.

00:26.420 --> 00:29.903
Black Jack, Today's Karte - Pinoco's School Entrance Exam Journal.

00:30.075 --> 00:36.698
I'm going to fly to where you are.

00:30.075 --> 00:36.698
kimi no moto e tonde yuku yo

00:37.033 --> 00:44.039
I know I can spread my wings when I want to see you.

00:37.033 --> 00:44.039
aitai toki tsubasa hiraku

00:44.624 --> 00:47.709
Nobody knows

00:44.624 --> 00:47.709
dara nimo wakaranai

00:48.128 --> 00:51.547
when a miracle might occur,

00:48.128 --> 00:51.547
kiseki wa itsu okiru?

00:51.548 --> 00:57.970
but it feels like my wish is finally coming true.

00:51.548 --> 00:57.970
nozomi wa kanaeraresou de

00:57.971 --> 01:04.768
Because there's only one place I want to go,

00:57.971 --> 01:04.768
mukau basho wa hitotsu shika nai kara

01:04.769 --> 01:08.021
iro asenai omoi yosete

01:04.769 --> 01:08.021
I gather my feelings whose colors never fade,

01:08.022 --> 01:11.567
and now it seems I'm dreaming.

01:08.022 --> 01:11.567
saa Dreaming now

01:12.152 --> 01:15.487
I'm living for your sake?

01:12.152 --> 01:15.487
kimi no tame ni iketeru

01:15.488 --> 01:18.657
I will be your strength,

01:15.488 --> 01:18.657
donna chikara nimo naru

01:18.950 --> 01:21.869
no matter how far apart we are.

01:18.950 --> 01:21.869
Far away Far away harukana

01:21.870 --> 01:25.664
So Freedom. So Freedom.

01:25.790 --> 01:29.251
I will send you

01:25.790 --> 01:29.251
kimi no tame no okurou

01:29.252 --> 01:32.504
the beautiful blossom of this flower.

01:29.252 --> 01:32.504
kirei ni saita hana wo

01:32.672 --> 01:35.591
So let's look for shooting stars.

01:32.672 --> 01:35.591
Shooting Star Shooting Star sagasou

01:35.592 --> 01:39.595
So Freedom. So Freedom.

02:47.967 --> 02:48.384
Signature please.

02:56.089 --> 02:56.880
Miss,

02:57.515 --> 02:58.831
Registered

02:57.515 --> 02:58.831
Dear Pinoco

02:59.509 --> 03:01.927
can you sign for this?

03:01.928 --> 03:04.219
N-No problem!

03:06.559 --> 03:07.898
Diploma
Pinoco

03:06.560 --> 03:07.898
has completed all coursework provided by the school with excellent
results and is, therefore, certified as a graduate of this school, ...

03:06.560 --> 03:07.898
No refunds under any circumstances.
Distance Education of Evil and Wicked

03:08.187 --> 03:09.240
Yay!

03:09.342 --> 03:10.852
I graduated!

03:10.853 --> 03:13.356
I really graduated!

03:13.523 --> 03:15.107
Yay!

03:15.775 --> 03:17.234
I graduated!

03:17.235 --> 03:18.443
Hooray!

03:18.444 --> 03:20.487
Um, sign, please...

03:24.575 --> 03:27.786
Originally "Pinoco's Challenge” by Tezuka Osamu

03:24.575 --> 03:27.786
Pinoco's School Entrance Exam Journal

03:36.683 --> 03:37.629
There.

03:42.343 --> 03:45.220
Graduation! Graduation! Congratulations!

03:45.221 --> 03:46.221
My dear Pinoco, congratu—

03:46.222 --> 03:48.056
Pinoco-chan, let's play!

03:49.006 --> 03:49.994
What's this?

03:50.018 --> 03:51.852
Is there something to celebrate?

03:54.105 --> 03:55.897
W-What?

03:55.898 --> 03:57.441
Sharaku-kun.

03:57.622 --> 03:58.275
Yes?

03:58.276 --> 04:01.737
You are still only in junior high, right?

04:02.363 --> 04:03.655
I am.

04:03.656 --> 04:05.115
What about it?

04:05.361 --> 04:09.244
I already graduated junior high.

04:10.174 --> 04:10.658
See?

04:13.080 --> 04:14.750
What's that?

04:15.434 --> 04:17.069
"Diploma."

04:17.163 --> 04:18.147
"Pinoco

04:18.171 --> 04:23.550
has completed all coursework provided by
the school with excellent results and is,

04:23.926 --> 04:27.186
therefore, certified as a graduate of this school.”

04:27.972 --> 04:30.891
When did you go to school?

04:31.064 --> 04:33.143
It's a school by mail.

04:33.144 --> 04:34.644
I kept it a secret.

04:34.645 --> 04:36.355
Not even Doc knows about it.

04:37.440 --> 04:40.984
I'm going to shock Doc!

04:40.985 --> 04:42.986
School by mail, huh?

04:42.987 --> 04:45.030
That's really awesome!

04:46.032 --> 04:51.470
"No refunds under any circumstances.”

04:52.283 --> 04:56.049
"Distance Education of Evil and Wicked."

04:56.209 --> 05:00.598
I paid the tuition up front and
they let me graduate right away.

05:02.715 --> 05:04.883
<i>Graduation as soon as the money is paid?</i>

05:04.884 --> 05:06.510
<i>It's bogus.</i>

05:06.687 --> 05:08.720
See, look!

05:08.721 --> 05:10.222
"Exam Qualifications”

05:10.223 --> 05:13.642
"Anyone with the academic ability
of a junior high graduate.”

05:13.643 --> 05:15.102
That's me!

05:15.144 --> 05:19.272
Pinoco-chan, I think that school by mail is—

05:19.306 --> 05:19.973
Yes?

05:22.245 --> 05:22.723
Well...

05:22.750 --> 05:23.750
Look, look.

05:24.164 --> 05:26.780
Their uniform is so darling.

05:27.240 --> 05:31.760
And these are stylish and more mature,
so they're perfect for me.

05:32.036 --> 05:34.454
Come on. Help me out, Sharaku.

05:34.455 --> 05:36.957
Which high school do you think is best for me?

05:37.458 --> 05:38.500
This is good too.

05:38.501 --> 05:39.668
What about this one?

05:44.144 --> 05:47.038
Oana High School

05:53.071 --> 05:56.226
Miss, stop joking around with me.

05:57.228 --> 05:59.563
What's so funny?

05:59.981 --> 06:04.596
You can't just bring this piece of paper and
ask me to let you take our entrance exam.

06:07.363 --> 06:08.864
It's not just a piece of paper!

06:08.970 --> 06:10.740
It's a diploma!

06:11.159 --> 06:16.413
You see, a diploma from a legitimate correspondence
school is recognized as valid,

06:16.456 --> 06:23.044
but there are also bogus diplomas by mail services
who let anyone graduate as long as they get paid.

06:23.463 --> 06:29.445
This diploma also doubles as the receipt for
the money transferred to their account.

06:33.681 --> 06:36.059
I have no idea what you're talking about!

06:36.434 --> 06:37.142
Hey!

06:37.338 --> 06:39.895
I graduated from junior high!

06:40.730 --> 06:43.659
So I can become a high school student, can't I?

06:43.900 --> 06:46.067
I want to enter this high school,

06:46.068 --> 06:49.321
so I want the exam application and stuff.

06:49.822 --> 06:55.076
You see, even if this diploma is real,

06:55.077 --> 06:57.852
you're only in kindergarten, right?

06:58.254 --> 07:00.874
Do your parents know about this?

07:00.875 --> 07:02.584
I'm not in kindergarten!

07:02.585 --> 07:05.045
I'm eighteen years old!

07:05.221 --> 07:07.005
You just can't tell!

07:07.168 --> 07:08.952
Stay out of this!

07:09.133 --> 07:14.707
Man, I can't spend all day dealing with this.

07:15.014 --> 07:16.640
No!

07:16.641 --> 07:19.351
I'm going to enter this high school!

07:19.352 --> 07:23.438
I graduated from junior high, so I'll go to high school!

07:23.439 --> 07:26.193
You need to go home before it gets dark.

07:26.442 --> 07:27.734
It's not safe walking after dark.

07:27.735 --> 07:29.965
No!

07:33.574 --> 07:34.366
Wait!

07:34.492 --> 07:36.201
No, I won't!

07:41.958 --> 07:43.291
Fight-o! Fight-o!

07:43.292 --> 07:46.169
Fight-o! Fight-o! Fight-o! Fight-o!

07:46.170 --> 07:47.420
Wait!

08:13.281 --> 08:14.114
No!

08:14.374 --> 08:16.199
I'll go to this school!

08:17.201 --> 08:20.702
Let me go, dummy!

08:21.747 --> 08:23.456
Pinoco-chan!

08:25.084 --> 08:25.750
Wato-san!

08:25.751 --> 08:27.419
What's the matter, Pinoco-chan?

08:30.590 --> 08:32.340
Pinoco-chan...

08:34.844 --> 08:35.927
I see.

08:36.387 --> 08:39.556
You graduated junior high through
a correspondence school, huh?

08:39.909 --> 08:43.321
So I can enter high school.

08:43.519 --> 08:46.521
I want to become a high school student.

08:46.656 --> 08:48.732
I'm eighteen years old.

08:48.733 --> 08:50.590
I want to go to school.

09:10.379 --> 09:11.613
Pinoco, are you here?

09:19.805 --> 09:22.415
What's the matter? Why are you sitting in the dark?

09:23.059 --> 09:24.105
Did something happen?

09:32.360 --> 09:33.853
A diploma...

09:34.570 --> 09:36.011
What's this?

09:37.698 --> 09:40.124
I want to go to school.

09:40.826 --> 09:45.056
I'm eighteen years old, so I'm supposed
to be a college student.

09:46.093 --> 09:47.765
Right, Doc?

09:48.417 --> 09:51.336
But I know I can't start with college.

09:52.385 --> 09:55.765
Even I know that.

09:56.258 --> 09:57.119
So...

09:58.010 --> 09:59.094
So...

10:09.522 --> 10:10.808
I understand what happened.

10:11.023 --> 10:12.357
Sorry for the bother.

10:12.650 --> 10:13.692
Wait.

10:14.110 --> 10:17.404
I didn't come here to complain
about the trouble she caused.

10:17.405 --> 10:20.156
She didn't cause any trouble for me.

10:20.616 --> 10:24.810
We came to talk to you because we know how she feels.

10:25.413 --> 10:27.831
She really wants to go to school!

10:28.000 --> 10:30.125
She's eighteen, right?

10:30.333 --> 10:32.877
I don't like studying all that much -

10:32.878 --> 10:34.761
actually, I hate it...

10:35.297 --> 10:36.840
but I like school

10:37.591 --> 10:40.388
because I made many friends there,

10:40.636 --> 10:43.722
and I found things I love, like club activities.

10:44.098 --> 10:46.057
There are sports and culture festivals too.

10:46.600 --> 10:50.103
We get to work together.

10:50.104 --> 10:53.815
We eat lunch together, and there're school trips too!

10:55.609 --> 10:56.630
What's your point?

10:57.027 --> 11:02.782
I-I'm sure that Pinoco-chan would love
to experience all those things too.

11:02.783 --> 11:06.202
Can't Pinoco-chan be granted that wish?

11:07.079 --> 11:09.205
Just because she is different from other people

11:09.832 --> 11:12.959
doesn't mean she's not allowed to
experience any of that, right?

11:13.070 --> 11:14.544
That's too mean!

11:14.651 --> 11:17.380
I don't think that's right.

11:28.350 --> 11:31.494
She was inside her older sister for eighteen years?

11:30.124 --> 11:31.630
Principal's Office

11:31.896 --> 11:34.503
You want me to believe such a wild story?

11:35.483 --> 11:39.152
I understand your situation,

11:39.153 --> 11:42.298
but she was never registered with the city office, right?

11:42.490 --> 11:45.581
Therefore, we cannot allow her to enroll here.

11:45.868 --> 11:47.035
There's no precedent.

11:47.036 --> 11:48.495
There is.

11:48.704 --> 11:53.875
There are even cases of academically accelerated
elementary schoolers accepted by universities.

11:54.251 --> 11:57.378
Yes, there is a system which permits skipping grades.

11:57.713 --> 12:00.256
So, does she excel academically?

12:00.466 --> 12:04.052
Let her take the exam and you can judge for yourselves.

12:04.428 --> 12:07.852
If she possesses the basic academic skills
that will allow her to study here,

12:08.140 --> 12:11.059
permit her to enroll here,

12:11.435 --> 12:13.010
just like any other student.

12:13.354 --> 12:17.357
But still, even if you claim she's eighteen...

12:19.485 --> 12:25.412
At my last check up, my health age
came out to be eighty years old.

12:26.053 --> 12:27.075
Would you like some?

12:27.076 --> 12:28.096
No, thank you.

12:28.369 --> 12:35.213
So, can I ask for senior citizen tickets, claiming I'm eighty?

12:35.501 --> 12:39.888
Nobody would take me seriously if I did that.

12:41.579 --> 12:42.323
What's this?

12:42.846 --> 12:43.553
It's money.

12:43.884 --> 12:46.501
I want a special arrangement with this.

12:47.972 --> 12:51.599
I'm an educator too!

12:51.600 --> 12:54.811
I can't accept bribes to admit her through the back door!

12:55.079 --> 12:58.483
I have my pride as an educator.

12:58.732 --> 13:00.733
Please take it away.

13:01.360 --> 13:04.130
I haven't mentioned anything about the back door.

13:04.572 --> 13:07.574
I'm asking you only to allow her to take the entrance exam.

13:08.765 --> 13:11.745
Allowing her to take the exam is the only thing that I want.

13:12.121 --> 13:14.539
Is that really so much to ask?

13:37.354 --> 13:38.813
Sign, please.

13:38.907 --> 13:39.324
OK.

13:43.799 --> 13:46.404
Exam Admission Certificate?

13:46.989 --> 13:48.502
Exam Admission Certificate?

13:49.325 --> 13:50.825
It's the exam ticket!

13:50.826 --> 13:52.201
Um...

13:52.202 --> 13:55.009
They mailed me the admission certificate!

13:55.247 --> 13:57.582
This means I can take the exam, right?

13:58.250 --> 13:59.542
Sign, please...

13:59.543 --> 14:01.044
Yay! Yee, yah!

14:01.045 --> 14:03.171
It's real!

14:03.172 --> 14:06.591
Doc! I can take the entrance exam!

14:06.672 --> 14:08.635
Yay!

14:08.755 --> 14:10.595
Is it really real?

14:10.596 --> 14:12.805
You can really take the entrance exam?

14:13.036 --> 14:13.358
Yup!

14:13.680 --> 14:14.208
See?

14:17.394 --> 14:18.311
What're those?

14:18.312 --> 14:20.813
They're exam good-luck charms from all over the country!

14:20.814 --> 14:24.150
Also, talismans from around the world, and angel charms!

14:26.028 --> 14:27.695
T-Thanks...

14:27.946 --> 14:30.365
Then, let's study.

14:30.366 --> 14:32.700
Are you going to take the exam too?

14:32.701 --> 14:33.723
I'm not.

14:33.911 --> 14:36.579
I'm going to help you study.

14:36.914 --> 14:37.914
Really?

14:38.374 --> 14:41.926
The active high school student will give
you thorough private tutoring.

14:42.127 --> 14:44.496
You will definitely be accepted.

14:46.131 --> 14:48.257
W-Why are you looking at me funny?

14:48.258 --> 14:54.347
Considering your normal grades,
where do you find such confidence?

14:54.516 --> 14:55.516
Hey, now...

14:55.766 --> 15:00.853
I'm currently in high school because
I passed this exam once upon a time.

15:00.854 --> 15:02.897
Please don't push her too hard.

15:05.442 --> 15:08.821
Her body is no different from a one-year-old's.

15:10.739 --> 15:12.625
Yes, of course.

15:15.995 --> 15:20.289
All right, let's start with elementary school subjects.

15:20.290 --> 15:22.770
In anything, you must start at the basics.

15:22.864 --> 15:24.002
Sure thing!

15:30.467 --> 15:32.301
Which problem are you on now?

15:32.302 --> 15:33.261
The first one.

15:33.262 --> 15:34.804
You can take your time.

15:34.805 --> 15:36.439
Think carefully.

15:44.148 --> 15:45.857
Why are you looking outside?

15:46.233 --> 15:48.625
I'm taking a break.

15:53.657 --> 15:56.993
Pinoco-chan couldn't even keep focused for five minutes.

15:56.994 --> 15:59.370
It's her first time, so we can't blame her.

15:59.371 --> 16:04.625
But she can support Dr. Black Jack
for hours during his operations.

16:04.626 --> 16:10.280
The one who is nervous, yet unable to
make any mistakes, is Dr. Black Jack.

16:10.758 --> 16:16.512
Pinoco-chan trusts the doctor 100 percent,
so she doesn't feel any pressure about failing.

16:16.513 --> 16:18.858
But it's different for this exam, huh?

16:19.494 --> 16:22.769
It's now Pinoco-chan herself who
cannot make any mistakes.

16:22.770 --> 16:25.064
Do you think she can take the exam?

16:25.622 --> 16:28.648
I want to let her, just like anyone else.

16:30.444 --> 16:33.112
One, two, three, four, five...

16:34.281 --> 16:36.407
I don't have enough fingers.

16:36.784 --> 16:40.078
Pinoco-chan, you need to be able
to add without using fingers.

16:40.079 --> 16:42.080
It's seven plus six, so it's twelve, right?

16:42.375 --> 16:43.706
It's thirteen.

16:44.625 --> 16:47.668
Onee-chan, it's an elementary school problem.

16:48.629 --> 16:50.379
It's just a simple mistake.

16:50.380 --> 16:53.257
Of course it's thirteen, silly.

16:53.258 --> 16:56.385
So, you multiply this thirteen by three...

16:56.487 --> 16:57.197
Let's see...

16:57.221 --> 16:58.971
Come on, pull yourself together!

16:58.972 --> 17:00.515
It's forty-one!

17:00.637 --> 17:01.637
Oh, right!

17:01.925 --> 17:03.392
It's thirty-nine!

17:09.316 --> 17:12.527
I'll help you starting today.

17:12.528 --> 17:14.320
OK! Thanks.

17:14.321 --> 17:15.699
Thank you very much.

17:18.543 --> 17:19.617
Done!

17:21.120 --> 17:23.046
Pinoco-chan, you fell asleep.

17:25.415 --> 17:28.609
Now, can you do the rest of that problem set?

17:28.916 --> 17:29.322
OK.

17:31.583 --> 17:32.925
OK, done!

17:34.591 --> 17:35.980
You were asleep again.

17:36.321 --> 17:38.179
Should we take a break for a bit?

17:38.887 --> 17:41.097
I prepared delicious iced coffee.

17:43.200 --> 17:45.643
I'm really done this time!

17:52.901 --> 17:55.695
I'll really make my way in.

17:59.804 --> 18:01.726
Doc, I'm off now.

18:02.286 --> 18:05.264
Don't forget to write your name on the answer sheet.

18:05.539 --> 18:09.375
Even if you get all the answers right, they'll give
you zero points if you don't put your name on it.

18:09.493 --> 18:10.106
OK.

18:17.250 --> 18:21.707
You may exit the room thirty minutes into the exam.

18:25.058 --> 18:28.102
Please turn the answer sheet over when
we signal the end of the exam.

18:29.104 --> 18:31.240
Officials will collect the sheets at the back of the room.

18:39.781 --> 18:40.431
Begin!

18:52.113 --> 18:54.446
Writing: "Pinoco"

18:57.341 --> 18:59.050
My tummy hurts...

19:17.653 --> 19:18.361
Pinoco!

19:18.362 --> 19:19.308
Doctor!

19:19.738 --> 19:23.115
Apparently, Pinoco-chan got a sudden tummy ache.

19:30.832 --> 19:32.705
It's probably from psychological stress.

19:33.085 --> 19:36.462
The stress was too great for Pinoco's
undeveloped nervous system.

19:36.685 --> 19:38.578
You can treat her, right?

19:38.924 --> 19:40.177
We'll take her to my place right away.

19:40.884 --> 19:42.898
You said, "just like anyone else”,

19:43.428 --> 19:45.774
but Pinoco is different from regular people.

19:49.799 --> 19:50.923
Hang in there.

19:51.395 --> 19:52.715
I'll get you well in no time.

19:54.502 --> 19:55.875
just as I suspected,

19:55.899 --> 19:57.566
her tummy ache was caused
by biliary dyskinesia.

19:57.902 --> 20:00.214
It's not splachnopathy,
but a psychosomatic case.

20:00.612 --> 20:03.509
As I thought, Pinoco cannot
withstand the stress of exams.

20:10.087 --> 20:11.087
How is she?

20:16.035 --> 20:17.004
I'm sorry.

20:17.212 --> 20:19.107
I pushed you too hard, didn't I?

20:19.423 --> 20:22.000
The exam didn't work out.

20:23.579 --> 20:26.053
Don't worry about anything for now.

20:26.054 --> 20:27.555
Get some sleep.

20:29.725 --> 20:33.894
I'll take it one more time.

20:34.521 --> 20:38.858
Your body is different from other peoples', Pinoco,

20:38.945 --> 20:39.373
so...

20:40.569 --> 20:44.615
So I'll take the kindergarten exam next.

20:44.823 --> 20:48.861
I need to start with kindergarten, right?

20:49.661 --> 20:53.748
I did write my name on the exam sheet, Doc.

20:55.721 --> 20:58.535
Odazaki Kindergarten

21:06.428 --> 21:08.452
Pinoco, that was from your kindergarten.

21:10.223 --> 21:12.150
They asked you not to come back.

21:12.934 --> 21:13.809
OK...

21:18.357 --> 21:19.997
Pinoco-chan,

21:20.484 --> 21:22.818
can you come, with me for a minute?

21:23.945 --> 21:26.006
Where to?

21:34.289 --> 21:35.706
Pino High School?!

21:43.048 --> 21:44.716
Let's study together.

21:44.883 --> 21:46.072
Pinoco-chan,

21:46.760 --> 21:47.593
here!

21:47.594 --> 21:50.012
I had to stay up all night to take it in.

21:51.598 --> 21:52.973
Thanks.

21:53.964 --> 21:55.535
Doc, look!

21:56.770 --> 21:59.089
Now I'm a high school girl!

22:03.159 --> 22:04.777
Now, Pinoco-chan,

22:04.778 --> 22:09.323
you are now admitted into Pino High School
to be held once a month for an hour.

22:09.324 --> 22:11.186
Please study hard.

22:11.628 --> 22:13.160
Aye-aye!

22:13.787 --> 22:16.455
Class is now in session.

22:24.064 --> 22:29.176
As you look at the ground uncertainly,

22:24.064 --> 22:29.176
tamerai gachi no fuseta hitomi

22:29.177 --> 22:34.473
I gently pull your hair closer to me.

22:29.177 --> 22:34.473
kono te ga sono kami hikiyoseteta

22:35.104 --> 22:41.605
You didn't speak, but only sighed,

22:35.104 --> 22:41.605
nani mo iezu ni kobore ochita tameiki

22:41.606 --> 22:46.068
and wet my chest with your tears.

22:41.606 --> 22:46.068
namida ga mune wo nurashita

22:46.069 --> 22:51.323
You longed to hear it, even if it was a lie.

22:46.069 --> 22:51.323
use demo ii... to kitto nozonde ita

22:51.324 --> 22:56.078
But I couldn't give you the answer you wanted.

22:51.324 --> 22:56.078
kimi no kimochi ni kotae kirezu

22:56.079 --> 23:04.503
If I gave you that answer, despite my cowardice,

22:56.079 --> 23:04.503
okubyou na boku ga moshi sono toki kotaetetara mada

23:04.504 --> 23:08.090
would we still be together?

23:04.504 --> 23:08.090
tsuzuiteita noka?

23:08.091 --> 23:13.387
That irregular breath my body was accustomed to,

23:08.091 --> 23:13.387
karada ga oboeta fukisoku na breath

23:13.391 --> 23:18.851
I want to feel it one more time.

23:13.391 --> 23:18.851
mou ichido subete de kanjitai

23:18.852 --> 23:24.356
The breath of surprise when I lost everything.

23:18.852 --> 23:24.356
subete wo nakushita fuyoui na breath

23:24.357 --> 23:33.532
And the pain that binds me every time I feel regret.

23:24.357 --> 23:33.532
kuyamu tabi mata sono itami ga shimetsukeru

23:45.116 --> 24:15.031
An Old Man and the Big Tree

23:45.564 --> 23:47.303
It's the fantasy between an
old man and a big tree.

23:47.447 --> 23:49.903
The big tree that has
lived for a long time

23:50.020 --> 23:53.014
uses its last remaining energy
to give the old man a miracle.

23:54.075 --> 23:54.581
Hey!

23:55.686 --> 23:57.105
What are you trying to do to this tree?

23:57.327 --> 23:58.809
Of course, that zelkova tree will also be...

23:59.081 --> 24:01.248
No! Please don't cut it down!

24:01.601 --> 24:02.512
We'll squat around it.

24:02.784 --> 24:04.430
I will protect her!

24:05.222 --> 24:06.742
Come back, old man!

24:07.145 --> 24:11.454
Perhaps both you and
I have lived too long.

24:11.642 --> 24:14.931
Black Jack, Next Karte - An Old Man and the Big Tree.

24:15.867 --> 24:17.541
Karte NG...

24:18.411 --> 24:20.079
That's me!

24:22.230 --> 24:24.591
Dang it, Sharaku! Get it right!
